WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Sixteen pale metallic bands surround a dark sphere. A moving light catches their edges.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The camera draws close to the bands. Fine ridges extend beyond the frame as the dark sphere grows in view.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
From above, the bands gather into a rippling spiral. Warm light travels across the curved surfaces.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The rings tilt and separate into an open fan. The camera arcs around the unfolding form.

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The bands return to a quieter orbit. The sculpture settles beneath a final trace of light.
